  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "触发源与事件归属",
      "items": [
        "PCF notification 是 PCF → SCP → OpenAMSM 的既有网络侧回调，不是 AMF → Host 的 Nsmf 请求",
        "OpenAMSM 以受信 scoped event 把准确 Session、触发原因和 generation 交给 Host；Host 决定对应 Run 的启动或继续",
        "SMF-local timer / decision 是 Owner 内部触发，不应伪装成 PCF 或 AMF 消息"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Modify 流程",
      "items": [
        "按 OES：m0 → m2（optional）→ m3 → m4 → m5",
        "PCF notification 已代表策略侧事件；不重复画一个无依据的 Npcf Update",
        "m4 的 N1/N2 结果经 SCP 回到 Host，再按 exact occurrence 交还 OpenAMSM；m5 才消费 AN tunnel 信息"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "四责任域",
      "items": [
        "外部 5GC：PCF / SCP / AMF / UE-gNB / UPF",
        "CA-Agent：Host scoped-event ingress、Session Router、Runtime Run",
        "CA Client Tools：固定 Owner-private / Namf egress",
        "OpenAMSM：SMF Owner、OES、GSM、PFCP；N4 直连 UPF"
      ]
    }
  ]
